to make extra money. Need to find a studio? Studios listed worldwide. Add yours today!\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container page-header-nav-wrap","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-content","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Voiceover Studio Finder "}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Voiceover Studio Finder allows voices to book one while travelling, and agencies the chance to book one nearer the artist.</p>"}}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-arrows","children":[null,null]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Why create this listings site?</h2>\r\n<p>Firstly, I've made money hiring my studio to other voices including actors from Emmerdale. Secondly, I read a blog from a fellow voice artist He talked of looking for nearby studios when he was away.<br>\r\nI felt there was a gap in the market to create something that not only helped other voices but a facility to help agencies book actors or voices into nearby studios without the expense of getting them to major cities. <em>\"There are some great studios outside the big cities\"</em></p>"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/VO0jENx53VE","title":"Voiceover Studio Finder ","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-img-card","children":[["$","img",